[02:08.57]On a dark desert highway
{"行驶在漆黑的荒漠公路"}
[02:11.89]Cool wind in my hair
{"凉风掠过发梢"}
[02:14.61]Warm smell of colitas
{"空气中飘来温热的大麻香"}
[02:18.00]Rising up through the air
{"在四周缓缓升腾"}
[02:21.52]Up ahead in the distance
{"前方远处"}
[02:24.49]I saw a shimmering light
{"我看见闪烁的微光"}
[02:27.66]My head grew heavy, and my sight grew dim
{"我的头脑昏沉视线模糊"}
[02:30.72]I had to stop for the night
{"不得不停下过夜"}
[02:34.44]There she stood in the doorway
{"她站在门廊处"}
[02:37.25]HEard the mission bell
{"远处传来教堂钟声"}
[02:40.50]And I was thinking to myself
{"我暗自思忖"}
[02:42.91]"This could be heaven or this could be hell"
{"这里或许是天堂也可能是地狱"}}
[02:46.94]Then she lit up a candle
{"随后她点燃蜡烛"}
[02:50.40]And she showed me the way
{"为我指引方向"}
[02:53.54]There were voices down the corridor
{"走廊尽头传来人声"}
[02:56.52]Thought I heard them say
{"依稀听见他们说"}
[03:00.07]Welcome to the Hotel California
{"欢迎来到加州旅馆"}
[03:05.21]Such a lovely place (such a lovely place)
{"多么美好的地方（多么美好的地方）"}
[03:08.73]Such a lovely face
{"多么迷人的脸庞"}
[03:12.22]There's plenty of room at the Hotel California
{"加州旅馆永远有空房"}
[03:18.23]Any time of year (any time of year)
{"一年四季（一年四季）"}
[03:21.41]You can find it here
{"你都能找到它"}
[03:25.14]Her mind is Tiffany-twisted
{"她沉迷于蒂芙尼的奢靡"}
[03:28.38]She got the Mercedes Benz, uh
{"拥有奔驰轿车"}
[03:31.70]She got a lot of pretty, pretty boys, she calls friends
{"结识许多漂亮男孩称他们为朋友"}
[03:38.18]How they dance in the courtyard
{"他们在庭院里翩翩起舞"}
[03:41.28]Sweet summer sweat
{"甜蜜的夏日汗水"}
[03:44.75]Some dance to remember
{"有人为铭记而舞"}
[03:47.64]Some dance to forget
{"有人为遗忘而舞"}
[03:50.99]So I called up the Captain
{"于是我唤来领班"}
[03:54.24]"Please, bring me my wine"
{"请给我拿些酒来"}}
[03:56.61]He said, "We haven't had that spirit here since 1969"
{"他说「自1969年后我们就不再供应这种酒」"}}
[04:03.99]And still those voices are calling from far away
{"那些声音仍在远方呼唤"}
[04:10.15]Wake you up in the middle of the night
{"将你从午夜惊醒"}
[04:13.42]Just to hear them say
{"只为听他们说"}
[04:16.72]Welcome to the Hotel California
{"欢迎来到加州旅馆"}
[04:22.14]Such a lovely place (such a lovely place)
{"多么美好的地方（多么美好的地方）"}
[04:25.68]Such a lovely face
{"多么迷人的脸庞"}
[04:29.15]They're living it up at the Hotel California
{"他们在加州旅馆纵情享乐"}
[04:35.28]What a nice surprise (what a nice surprise)
{"多么美妙的惊喜（多么美妙的惊喜）"}
[04:38.34]Bring your alibis
{"带上你的托辞"}
[04:42.45]Mirrors on the ceiling
{"天花板上镶满镜子"}
[04:45.89]Pink champagne on ice
{"冰镇粉红香槟"}
[04:47.89]And she said, "We are all just prisoners here of our own device"
{"她说「我们都是自愿被困在此的囚徒」"}}
[04:55.55]And in the master's chambers
{"而在主人的厅堂里"}
[04:58.64]They gathered for the feast
{"他们齐聚赴宴"}
[05:02.01]They stab it with their steely knives
{"用钢刀刺向猎物"}
[05:04.73]But they just can't kill the beast
{"却始终无法杀死那野兽"}
[05:08.56]Last thing I remember
{"最后的记忆里"}
[05:11.35]I was running for the door
{"我正冲向大门"}
[05:15.25]I had to find the passage back
{"我必须找到回去的路"}
[05:17.50]To the place I was before
{"回到我从前的地方"}
[05:21.56]"Relax," said the night man
{"「放轻松」 守夜人说道"}}
[05:24.30]"We are programmed to receive"
{"我们被设定为接待"}}
[05:27.70]"You can check out any time you like"
{"你可以随时结账"}}
[05:31.16]"But you can never leave"
{"但你永远无法离开"}}
[05:35.21]
[06:58.58]Thank you
[07:01.35]
[07:06.87]Thank you
[07:07.14]
